icon-sound-on"></i></button><button tabindex="0" class="AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 bIENxt AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 bIENxt TextLinkStyle-sc-1lcxj9v-0 dRamhL ArticleAction-sc-z0lvxr-0 cYeZKe">Increase size<i role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="StyledIcon-sc-d1cgde-0 cOdgPK icon-article-font-size"></i></button><div id="rsplayer" class="StyledPlayer-sc-ee309q-0 clDYgm rsbtn rs_addtools rs_splitbutton rs_preserve rs_skip"><a class="rsbtn_play"></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col py-content-block-gap-0.5 empty:py-0 gap-y-content-block-gap *:[.content-block-sponsorbanner]:-my-content-block-gap-0.25 *:[.content-block-missionstatement]:-my-content-block-gap-0.5 *:[.content-block-fcbayerntv]:-my-content-block-gap-0.5 *:[.content-block-featured\_news]:-my-content-block-gap-0.5 **:[.spacer-no-top-space]:-mt-content-block-gap-0.5 rs_content *:[.content-block-markdown]:-my-content-block-gap-0.5 *:[.content-block-markdown]:pbs-content-block-gap-0.5 *:[.content-block-image:has(+_.content-block-markdown)]:-my-content-block-gap-0.5 *:[.content-block-image:has(+_.content-block-markdown)]:pbs-content-block-gap-0.5"><div class="content-block-markdown" data-upscore-zone="content(MARKDOWN): 7ccff5a8-db2c-40a0-be35-d62f35d33bb3"><div class="width-limiter"><div class="xl:w-8/12 mx-auto"><div class="HtmlLayout-sc-rtuvje-0 cgmGct"><p class="StyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-3 _StyledStyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-5 dynyXw jbUAMJ"><a href="https://allianz-arena.com/en/getting-here/matchday" tabindex="0" class="AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 bIENxt AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 dIROaF BaseButton-sc-1xll8s8-0 StyledButton-sc-1xll8s8-1 jsVtwA lhpMaE StyledButton-sc-rtuvje-8 gqdNHh rs_skip"><span class="truncate">Matchday</span></a> <a href="https://allianz-arena.com/en/getting-here/non-matchday" tabindex="0" class="AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 bIENxt AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 dIROaF BaseButton-sc-1xll8s8-0 StyledButton-sc-1xll8s8-1 jsVtwA dliwT StyledButton-sc-rtuvje-8 gqdNHh rs_skip"><span class="truncate">Non-matchday</span></a></p></div></div></div></div><div class="content-block-markdown" data-upscore-zone="content(MARKDOWN): fe6e123b-bfbc-4c5a-83e8-b3b04d15a1f8"><div class="width-limiter"><div class="xl:w-8/12 mx-auto"><div class="HtmlLayout-sc-rtuvje-0 cgmGct"><h2 class="Title-sc-rtuvje-1 _StyledTitle-sc-rtuvje-2 bqQvIn">Information and tips on getting to Allianz Arena</h2>

<p class="StyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-3 _StyledStyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-5 dynyXw"><strong>Allianz Arena | 80939 München | Franz-Beckenbauer-Platz 5<br/>
The Allianz Arena is located outside the low-emission zone.</strong></p>

<p class="StyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-3 _StyledStyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-5 dynyXw">There are many ways to get to the Allianz Arena in München-Fröttmaning – from bike through to the underground. Cars, buses and motorbikes access the new temple of football via the motorway. You’ll find details below on how to get to the Arena by any means of transport. </p>

<p class="StyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-3 _StyledStyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-5 dynyXw">Information and tips on getting to München-Fröttmaning on <strong>non-matchdays</strong>: We recommend early travel due to potentially heavy traffic near the Allianz Arena.<br/>
Please follow the signs.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="content-block-accordion" data-upscore-zone="content(ACCORDION): d0376ef9-1cad-466a-bcfc-d6b2d8789d16"><div class="width-limiter"><div class="xl:w-8/12 mx-auto"><div class="Layout-sc-1mribp9-0 kcmJlb"><details><summary id=":R2ppklinap:" class="StyledSummary-sc-1mad1lt-0 ktkfAz"><div class="AccordionHeader-sc-1mad1lt-4 fbSOWk"><div class="AccordionTitleText-sc-1mad1lt-1 kglIlF"><div aria-hidden="true" class="AccordionIcon-sc-1mad1lt-2 fQyBKY"><i role="img" class="StyledIcon-sc-d1cgde-0 fnhRqI icon-train"></i></div><div class="AccordionTitle-sc-1mad1lt-3 gHQNMI">By public transport</div><i role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="StyledIcon-sc-d1cgde-0 kNzxKK icon-chevron-down-bold accordion-toggle-icon"></i></div></div></summary><div class="AccordionContent-sc-1mad1lt-5 bsIFKy"><div class="-mx-(--sizes-content-sidePadding)"><div><div class="width-limiter"><div class="HtmlLayout-sc-rtuvje-0 cgmGct"><p class="StyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-3 _StyledStyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-5 dynyXw"> The public transport services offered by the Munich transportation authority (Münchner Verkehrs- und Tarifverbund, MVV) will get you to the Allianz Arena comfortably and safely. Take the S-Bahn from Munich Main Station or Munich East Station to Marienplatz, a central transfer hub, it only takes a few minutes. From there take the U6 light rail line (in the direction of Garching-Forschungszentrum) to Fröttmaning. If you are coming from the underground, please follow the signs for ‘Eingang Süd/Home Fans’. The meeting point for the start of the arena tours is signposted on site.</p>

<h3 class="Title-sc-rtuvje-1 _StyledTitle-sc-rtuvje-2 exvLcT">Underground and P+R information</h3>

<p class="StyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-3 _StyledStyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-5 dynyXw"><a href="http://www.mvv-muenchen.de/en/homepage/index.html" tabindex="0" class="AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 bIENxt AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 dIROaF BaseButton-sc-1xll8s8-0 StyledButton-sc-1xll8s8-1 jsVtwA dliwT StyledButton-sc-rtuvje-8 gqdNHh rs_skip" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="truncate">Münchner Verkehrs- und Tarifverbund (MVV)</span><i role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="StyledIcon-sc-d1cgde-0 fnhRqI icon-arrow-exit"></i></a> <a href="http://efa.mvv-muenchen.de/mvv/XSLT_TRIP_REQUEST2?language=en" tabindex="0" class="AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 bIENxt AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 dIROaF BaseButton-sc-1xll8s8-0 StyledButton-sc-1xll8s8-1 jsVtwA dliwT StyledButton-sc-rtuvje-8 gqdNHh rs_skip" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="truncate">MVV timetable information</span><i role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="StyledIcon-sc-d1cgde-0 fnhRqI icon-arrow-exit"></i></a></p>

<p class="StyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-3 _StyledStyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-5 dynyXw"><a href="https://www.mvv-muenchen.de/en/tickets-and-fares/tickets-daytickets/airport-city-day-ticket/index.html" tabindex="0" class="AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 bIENxt AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 dIROaF BaseButton-sc-1xll8s8-0 StyledButton-sc-1xll8s8-1 jsVtwA dliwT StyledButton-sc-rtuvje-8 gqdNHh rs_skip" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="truncate">Public transport from Munich airport</span><i role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="StyledIcon-sc-d1cgde-0 fnhRqI icon-arrow-exit"></i></a></p></div></div></div></div></div></details><details><summary id=":R4ppklinap:" class="StyledSummary-sc-1mad1lt-0 ktkfAz"><div class="AccordionHeader-sc-1mad1lt-4 fbSOWk"><div class="AccordionTitleText-sc-1mad1lt-1 kglIlF"><div aria-hidden="true" class="AccordionIcon-sc-1mad1lt-2 fQyBKY"><i role="img" class="StyledIcon-sc-d1cgde-0 fnhRqI icon-car"></i></div><div class="AccordionTitle-sc-1mad1lt-3 gHQNMI">By car, motorbike or coach</div><i role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="StyledIcon-sc-d1cgde-0 kNzxKK icon-chevron-down-bold accordion-toggle-icon"></i></div></div></summary><div class="AccordionContent-sc-1mad1lt-5 bsIFKy"><div class="-mx-(--sizes-content-sidePadding)"><div><div class="width-limiter"><div class="HtmlLayout-sc-rtuvje-0 cgmGct"><p class="StyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-3 _StyledStyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-5 dynyXw">If you travel on non-matchdays our coach park north (Busparkplatz Nord) can be used for visitor parking. Please follow the traffic guidance signs.</p>

<p class="StyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-3 _StyledStyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-5 dynyXw">• A9 motorway – take the 73 exit to München-Fröttmaning-Süd.<br/>
• A99 motorway – take the 12b exit to München-Fröttmaning-Nord.<br/>
 </p>

<h3 class="Title-sc-rtuvje-1 _StyledTitle-sc-rtuvje-2 exvLcT">Driving information</h3>

<p class="StyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-3 _StyledStyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-5 dynyXw"><a href="https://allianz-arena.com/binaries/content/assets/downloads/allianz-arena/parken/allar-umgebung-en.pdf?v=1753975462234" tabindex="0" class="AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 bIENxt AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 dIROaF BaseButton-sc-1xll8s8-0 StyledButton-sc-1xll8s8-1 jsVtwA lhpMaE StyledButton-sc-rtuvje-8 gqdNHh rs_skip" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="truncate">Route map</span></a> <a href="http://maps.google.de/maps?f=q&amp;hl=de&amp;q=Allianz-Arena,+Werner-Heisenberg-Allee,+Schwabing-Freimann+80939+M%C3%BCnchen,+M%C3%BCnchen,+Bayern,+Deutschland&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;z=16&amp;ll=48.218654,11.625702&amp;spn=0.006291,0.027122&amp;t=h&amp;om=1&amp;iwloc=A" tabindex="0" class="AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 bIENxt AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 dIROaF BaseButton-sc-1xll8s8-0 StyledButton-sc-1xll8s8-1 jsVtwA dliwT StyledButton-sc-rtuvje-8 gqdNHh rs_skip" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="truncate">Driving directions via Google maps</span><i role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="StyledIcon-sc-d1cgde-0 fnhRqI icon-arrow-exit"></i></a></p></div></div></div></div></div></details><details><summary id=":R6ppklinap:" class="StyledSummary-sc-1mad1lt-0 ktkfAz"><div class="AccordionHeader-sc-1mad1lt-4 fbSOWk"><div class="AccordionTitleText-sc-1mad1lt-1 kglIlF"><div aria-hidden="true" class="AccordionIcon-sc-1mad1lt-2 fQyBKY"><i role="img" class="StyledIcon-sc-d1cgde-0 fnhRqI icon-bike"></i></div><div class="AccordionTitle-sc-1mad1lt-3 gHQNMI">By bike</div><i role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="StyledIcon-sc-d1cgde-0 kNzxKK icon-chevron-down-bold accordion-toggle-icon"></i></div></div></summary><div class="AccordionContent-sc-1mad1lt-5 bsIFKy"><div class="-mx-(--sizes-content-sidePadding)"><div><div class="width-limiter"><div class="HtmlLayout-sc-rtuvje-0 cgmGct"><p dir="ltr" class="StyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-3 _StyledStyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-5 dynyXw">Without traffic jam and without parking stress, the Allianz Arena is also very easy to reach by bike, the route is well signposted in the Munich bicycle network.</p>

<p dir="ltr" class="StyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-3 _StyledStyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-5 dynyXw">At the Allianz Arena, there are sufficient bicycle parking spaces in the north (Busparkplatz Nord) right next to the entrances. Thus, you can use the not so busy North entrance and are therefore faster in your seats.</p>

<h3 class="Title-sc-rtuvje-1 _StyledTitle-sc-rtuvje-2 exvLcT">Further information</h3>

<p class="StyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-3 _StyledStyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-5 dynyXw"><a href="http://www.muenchen.de/int/en/traffic/biking.html" tabindex="0" class="AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 bIENxt AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 dIROaF BaseButton-sc-1xll8s8-0 StyledButton-sc-1xll8s8-1 jsVtwA dliwT StyledButton-sc-rtuvje-8 gqdNHh rs_skip" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="truncate">The route to the Arena in the Munich Radlnetz</span><i role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="StyledIcon-sc-d1cgde-0 fnhRqI icon-arrow-exit"></i></a></p></div></div></div></div></div></details><details><summary id=":R8ppklinap:" class="StyledSummary-sc-1mad1lt-0 ktkfAz"><div class="AccordionHeader-sc-1mad1lt-4 fbSOWk"><div class="AccordionTitleText-sc-1mad1lt-1 kglIlF"><div aria-hidden="true" class="AccordionIcon-sc-1mad1lt-2 fQyBKY"><i role="img" class="StyledIcon-sc-d1cgde-0 fnhRqI icon-taxi"></i></div><div class="AccordionTitle-sc-1mad1lt-3 gHQNMI">By taxi</div><i role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="StyledIcon-sc-d1cgde-0 kNzxKK icon-chevron-down-bold accordion-toggle-icon"></i></div></div></summary><div class="AccordionContent-sc-1mad1lt-5 bsIFKy"><div class="-mx-(--sizes-content-sidePadding)"><div><div class="width-limiter"><div class="HtmlLayout-sc-rtuvje-0 cgmGct"><p class="StyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-3 _StyledStyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-5 dynyXw">Taxis use the S1/S0 access, please follow the traffic guidance.</p></div></div></div></div></div></details><details><summary id=":Rappklinap:" class="StyledSummary-sc-1mad1lt-0 ktkfAz"><div class="AccordionHeader-sc-1mad1lt-4 fbSOWk"><div class="AccordionTitleText-sc-1mad1lt-1 kglIlF"><div aria-hidden="true" class="AccordionIcon-sc-1mad1lt-2 fQyBKY"><i role="img" class="StyledIcon-sc-d1cgde-0 fnhRqI icon-van"></i></div><div class="AccordionTitle-sc-1mad1lt-3 gHQNMI">Pitches for motor homes</div><i role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="StyledIcon-sc-d1cgde-0 kNzxKK icon-chevron-down-bold accordion-toggle-icon"></i></div></div></summary><div class="AccordionContent-sc-1mad1lt-5 bsIFKy"><div class="-mx-(--sizes-content-sidePadding)"><div><div class="width-limiter"><div class="HtmlLayout-sc-rtuvje-0 cgmGct"><p class="StyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-3 _StyledStyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-5 dynyXw">Except on matchdays, parking is permitted on the north coach park (motor home pitch). Please follow the traffic guidance system for this.</p>

<p class="StyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-3 _StyledStyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-5 dynyXw"><a href="https://allianz-arena.com/en/arena/services/parking-for-caravans" tabindex="0" class="AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 bIENxt AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 dIROaF BaseButton-sc-1xll8s8-0 StyledButton-sc-1xll8s8-1 jsVtwA eswogX StyledButton-sc-rtuvje-8 gqdNHh rs_skip" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="truncate">Further Information on motor home pitches</span></a></p>

<p class="StyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-3 _StyledStyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-5 dynyXw">Parking on the north coach park (motor home pitch) before a matchday is only possible until 19:00. <br/>
Please take account of our <a href="https://allianz-arena.com/en/fixtures/allianz-arena" tabindex="0" class="AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 bIENxt AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 dIROaF TextLinkStyle-sc-1lcxj9v-0 dRamhL">schedule</a> when planning your visit.  </p>

<p class="StyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-3 _StyledStyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-5 dynyXw">On <strong>matchdays</strong>, there is currently very limited parking available in the visitors’ section. Please follow the instructions of the parking and security service on site.</p></div></div></div></div></div></details><div class="BottomBorder-sc-1mribp9-1 XKafI"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="content-block-markdown" data-upscore-zone="content(MARKDOWN): bde6cc42-e7e3-4962-8202-bbdf200afcf5"><div class="width-limiter"><div class="xl:w-8/12 mx-auto"><div class="HtmlLayout-sc-rtuvje-0 cgmGct"><h2 class="Title-sc-rtuvje-1 _StyledTitle-sc-rtuvje-2 bqQvIn">Parking fees per day on non-match days on coach park north (45 minutes free)</h2>

<p class="StyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-3 _StyledStyledArticleText-sc-rtuvje-5 dynyXw">Cars &amp; motorbikes (including vans, camper vans and trailers): €5<br/>
Busses &amp; Coaches: €20<br/>
<a href="https://allianz-arena.com/en/arena/services/parking-for-caravans" tabindex="0" class="AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 bIENxt AnchorElement-sc-1vd5ygo-0 dIROaF TextLinkStyle-sc-1lcxj9v-0 dRamhL">Over night (camper vans and trailers) per night: €20</a><br/>
<br/>
